window.products.push({"id":422076,"name":"Dust Mite and Allergen Proof Fitted Mattress Encasing; “Premium Microfiber” (Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":176.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X0AXRANIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MISSION: ALLERGY Premium Microfiber Fabric is the ultimate allergen-barrier: totally effective, silky soft, lightweight, and imperceptible beneath the sheets. It is extremely tightly woven, with a mean pore size of 2 microns to block all allergens, yet is air-permeable, making it completely comfortable to sleep on. It is not hot and sweaty, as are encasing fabrics made with membranes; does not allow any allergen escape, as do many cotton encasings; and does not accumulate surface allergen, as do encasings made with terry cloth or non-woven fabric. MISSION: ALLERGY Allergen-Proof Mattress Encasings are manufactured with the highest quality sewing construction, with all seams and edges bound for durability. This FITTED MODEL (no zipper) encasing is constructed like a fitted sheet to cover the mattress top and sides, and is ideal for airbeds, waterbeds or travel, where a zippered encasing is impractical. These medical-grade encasings are suitable for adults or children with allergic asthma, allergic rhinitis, or allergic eczema (or simply for good hygiene). They are the ultimate fitted allergen-proof encasing for comfort, protection, and durability. 100% Woven Polyester Microfiber. Lifetime warranty. “… protect both your pillows and your mattress with special mite-proof covers, experts say. Be sure you get covers from a reputable company, like Mission: Allergy…” THE NEW YORK TIMES: Much Ado About Dust Mites “Say sayonara to dust mites. The fix is to use hypoallergenic encasements on my mattress and pillows. Dr. Fost recommends Mission: Allergy.” HEALTH MAGAZINE: How healthy is your bedroom? “…The first step in your mite-control mission: the right pillow and mattress covers. Skip the cheapie versions—their weave isn't tight enough. Instead, invest in Mission: Allergy Premium Microfiber Allergen-Proof Encasings.” MEN’S HEALTH MAGAZINE: Clearing the Air on Allergies","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X0AXRANIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mission","source_asin":"B009AWR3MM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009AWR3MM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009AWR3MM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
