window.products.push({"id":422115,"name":"OXO Strive 16oz Insulated Tumbler with Sliding Lid - Rose Quartz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tQXJnVqDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OXO Strive Insulated Tumbler with Easy-Close Lid (16 oz/475) keeps drinks hot (or cold!) all day long. The Insulated Tumbler is sized to fit most car cup holders and features an easy-close design to help minimize messes. The wide lid opening is big enough for sipping or for reusable straws. The Insulated Tumbler’s double-wall vacuum insulation keeps your cold drinks cold for 12 hours, and your hot drinks hot for 6 hours. Dishwasher safe, stainless steel, BPA free. By choosing to reuse, you’re doing better for the planet. For over 30 years, we’ve designed products that make every day better at home. By committing 1% of our annual sales to support environmental nonprofits, we’re pledging to make every day better for the planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tQXJnVqDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B0BLD24VWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLD24VWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLD24VWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
