window.products.push({"id":422165,"name":"Ovente Portable Electric Hot Water Kettle 1.7 Liter Stainless Steel 1100 Watt Power Fast Heating Element Countertop Tea Maker Boiler Heater with Autom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BpF+W-SmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ovente KS96 is a high-class stainless steel electric kettle that flatters any kitchen countertop. It’s available in 3 different colors: brushed (silver), macaron cream, and red. It also comes with a 1 YEAR WARRANTY, so rest assured, Ovente has your back.With its 1.7L capacity and 1100-Watts of power, it is proven to be 50% more efficient than stovetop kettles in reducing your daily electricity use due to its speed. The kettle has a concealed water heating element to prevent mineral build-up, a flip-back lid for convenient filling, and a removable/washable filter to ensure the purest results. For safety purposes, this kettle is equipped with auto shut-off, boil-dry protection, secure locking lid, LED indicator light, cool touch button and a comfortable stay-cool handle. It also comes equipped with a 30-in cord that wraps neatly into the base for easy storage. Instructions for use:1. Fill with water up to desired amount2. Push the steam switch button down.3. This kettle will boil water in less than 7 minutes (at maximum level), and hot water will be ready to use for coffee, tea, hot cereal, instant macaroni or oatmeal, etc. Before first use, fill kettle to MAX (1.7L), bring to a full boil, and wait until the indicator light turns off before using. Specifications:-Capacity: 1.7 Liters-Wattage: 1100 Watts-Measurements: 9.9 x 6.7 x 9.9 inches-Material: High-Grade Stainless Steel, BPA-Free Plastic(Water Gauge, Inner Lid)-Plug: 3-prong-Features: Concealed Heating Element, Removable/washable spout filter, On/Off LED Light Indicator, Clear Water Level Gauge-Safety: Automatic Shut-Off, Boil-Dry Protection, Stay-Cool Handle, Secure Locking LidNote: Electric kettles may reach boiling faster at higher altitudes due to the fluctuation of boiling points. Because of this, the kettle may not shut off on its own.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BpF+W-SmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B085VN6C6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085VN6C6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085VN6C6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
