window.products.push({"id":422240,"name":"Bush Furniture WC81430 L Shaped Desk with Storage, 60W, Maple Cross","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":449.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710ylC8RNpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make a professional statement and maximize your home office capabilities with the Bush Furniture Somerset 60W L Shaped Desk in Maple Cross. This expansive workspace allows plenty of room to spread out and complete large projects. Create your remote work headquarters with space for your computer, phone, printer and more. Store your keyboard or laptop on a convenient pull-out tray. The beautiful and functional L Shaped Desk design includes a concealed storage cabinet for a computer tower or supplies, with rear wire access to eliminate cable clutter. Place pens, paper and more office utensils in the box drawer, and enjoy a file drawer gliding on smooth ball bearing slides for an easy reach to letter-sized documents. Transitional styling includes tapered leg accents, charming Maple Cross finish and contemporary metal hardware for an alluring appearance to match your current decor. Mount the keyboard tray and pedestals on either side of the L Shaped Desk for a customized home office design. This quality furniture comes with a 6 Year Manufacturer's Warranty and meets ANSI/SOHO test standards for safety and performance. See the full collection for coordinating items available. American made with U.S. and imported parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710ylC8RNpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0BWJZC7PD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJZC7PD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJZC7PD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":422241,"name":"HBlife Bartender Kit 23 Piece Cocktail Shaker Set with Stand, Stainless Steel Bar Set Include All Basic and Additional Bar Accessories, Creat a Perfec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71seVVZ8KtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"23 PIECE COCKTAIL SHAKER SET FOR ALL YOU NEED » From basic spirits to cocktails, this bartender kit contains all the essentials needed to create the perfect tipple. Bar tools include 25 oz shaker, 0.5/1.01oz double jigger, strainer, muddler, ice tongs, cocktail spoon, 2 pourers and bottle stoppers, 4 straws, corkscrew, straw brush, storage velvet bag, acrylic stand, and a professional cocktails booklet w/ over 100 cocktail recipes and tricks. An additional 4 whiskey stones complete the bar set. PREMIUM 304 STAINLESS STEEL » The HBlfie cocktail shaker bar tools set is crafted of beautiful 18/8 durable stainless steel, scratch-proof and fingerprint-free. The attractive mirrored finish means this bar set looks great on the cabinet or countertop. The cocktail shaker is designed with an inner wire drawing which means when shaking the bartender, it makes the contact more frictional and it is easier to shake evenly. All parts can be washed in the dishwasher. THE NEATEST STORAGE IN THE BAR CART » Each accessory fits closely to the hole of the stand, unlike other bar set accessories on the market that will loosen and fall when placed on the stand. All the bar tools are neatly stored and beautiful displayed on the designed stand. No more clutter in your kitchen drawers and cabinets. No more worry about losing any bar tools. You can also put the bar accessories in the storage bag to prevent dust. BE THE BEST GIFT-GIVER » A practical cocktail shaker set (the bar accessories can also be used in the kitchen) and a professional cocktails booklet. Whether it's a wedding, Christmas, Father's day or any other occasion, it will be very suitable and liked. The HBlife bar set comes in a nicely designed black box, making it the perfect gift for any cocktail lover in your life. That's if you can resist the temptation to keep it for yourself, of course! BUILD YOUR FIRST (AND BEST) HOME BAR » Rome wasn’t built in a day and your home bar doesn’t have to be, either. But if you’d like, we are doing just that! Helping you build your dream home bar, not building Rome in a day… obviously.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71seVVZ8KtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBlife","source_asin":"B0BTDB4VCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTDB4VCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTDB4VCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":422242,"name":"Personalized Custom Pet Chihuahua Fleece and Sherpa Throw Blanket for Men, Women, Kids, Babies - Matching Pet Blankets Perfect for Bedtime, Bedding or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TpEJdM3kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TpEJdM3kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07S75Q2CW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S75Q2CW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S75Q2CW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":422243,"name":"Forever Rose Beauty and The Beast Flower: Preserved 3\" Enchanted Decor Red Rose in a Glass Dome - Chic Roses/Flowers - Cool Decorations for Bedrooms o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lkgN4dBIL._AC_SL1023_.jpg","description":"LONG LASTING From their scent to vibrant, beautiful colors, flowers spread joy and love. If only that feeling could last for more than a few days. But with preserved flowers from Holy Chic Los Angeles, you get beauty that lasts. Our chic Petite Cherie Glass Dome arrangement features a single red rose enclosed in an elegant glass dome. Each flower features a delicate touch and appearance that makes it nearly impossible to differentiate from freshly cut blooms. Our preservation process uses only non-toxic, non-corrosive and non-carcinogenic substances making them completely safe for both your health and the environment. ENCHANTED ROSE With the Holy Chic Los Angeles rose, you can live your own fairy tale. Modeled after the Enchanted Rose from Beauty and the Beast, this is our chic version of the fairy tale flower, minus the falling petals. This arrangement is perfect for anyone looking to add unique and magical decor to their home. It also makes a great gift for a loved one, whether for a birthday, anniversary or just because. GORGEOUS GLASS DOME The Holy Chic Los Angeles Petite Cherie Glass Dome isn’t your typical flower arrangement. Unlike your standard bouquet or flower box, our preserved flower is featured in a beautiful glass dome making it an eye catching addition to any room. And with this arrangement you never have to worry about watering. UNIQUE DECOR Looking for a way to add unique flair to your home decor? The Holy Chic Los Angeles Petite Cherie Glass Dome is the perfect accessory for your living room or bedroom that’s sure to make an impression. Guests will be amazed at the vibrant color and quality design of our preserved rose and glass dome. EASY CARE Under proper care, our roses are designed to last for more than a year, sometimes even 3 to 5 years. To maximize the lifespan of your rose, keep the flower in the enclosure and away from water and direct sunlight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lkgN4dBIL._AC_SL1023_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holychic LA","source_asin":"B07L96Q4VF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L96Q4VF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L96Q4VF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":422244,"name":"Mother Of The Bride Wine Gift Bags, Burlap Wine Bottle Cover Bag For Wedding, Engegement Party, Party Favors, 1 Pc Wine Bag (A33)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YIEYVS85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.Durable Fabric: Wine gift bags are made of 100% natural cotton linen, reusable, high quality and safe to hold wine bottle. 2.Bags Size: Each bag is 6.3\" width and 13.4\" length. 1 pc burlap wine bag per package (bag only). Suitable for a regular 750 ml wine bottle champagne bottle or all standard size wine bottles. 3.Surprise Gift: A perfect gift bag for Besties, BFF, Friends, Family, Parents, Husband, wife. 4.Unique Design: Exquisite and fun text graphic, durable and odorless material, wine bag with drawstring. 5.Wine Bag Care: Hand washing or machine washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YIEYVS85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huastatewolf","source_asin":"B09FWZTHZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FWZTHZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FWZTHZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
