window.products.push({"id":422297,"name":"Steelcase Leap Office Chair, Black Frame and Buzz2 Black Fabric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1062.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417gt3KPk3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Adjustable in every way, Leap is the chair of choice for people who seek optimal, personalized support. The contoured backrest features LiveBack(TM) technology that changes shape as you move to support your entire spine in its natural, healthy S-shape. Height adjustable lumbar and lower back firmness control let you set your preferred level of support for your lumbar spine. The patented Natural Glide(TM) adjustment allows the seat to glide forward so you can recline without leaving your optimal zone for seeing and reaching your work. Our proprietary seat cushion design leverages built in air pockets that conform to your body and flexible edges that relieve pressure points under your thighs. Features include adjustable seat depth, height, width, pivot and depth adjustable arms, adjustable lumbar, lower back firmness control, seat height adjustment, recline tension adjustment, 5 position recline lock, upholstered back and seat, and wheels for carpet flooring. Arrives fully assembled and is backed by a 12 year warranty. From the Manufacturer The streamlined, stylish contour of the Steelcase Leap chair is just the beginning. The Leap is the first chair that actually changes shape to support your movements! With its Live Back technology, it moves dynamically as your back moves, mimicking the movement of your spine; the arms of the chair move in and out, forward and back; the seat glides forward so you can recline without leaving your vision and reach zone, and stay oriented to your work. Even when leaning forward, the seat edge flexes to relieve pressure on the back of the legs. In short, the Leap chair's ergonomic advances allow you to work comfortably, and more productively, in a proven healthy manner for extended periods of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417gt3KPk3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Steelcase","source_asin":"B007IEQYB0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007IEQYB0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007IEQYB0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
