window.products.push({"id":422317,"name":"Kelleci 3 Pack Metal Straws with Case Collapsable and keychain - Stainless Steel Telescopic straws, Eco-friendly, Reusable Straws - Premium Black Meta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q7UMD88fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do YOU need more attention ? BE COOL ! with Kelleci Stainless Steel Collapsible Straw.. Just take it out from your bag and see the 👀 on you ! and tell them that you do something to save the 🌎 by using your special straw and avoiding to use plastic straws !! Don't you want to own one for you and 2 extra ? The Value Pack includes 3 set !! Moreover %25 OFF! Adjustable Length The length of straws can be adjusted from 3.9 inches to 9.2 inches, and it fits for cups, glasses, and tumblers with different heights. Easy to Clean The adjustable metal brush can be used to cleaning the whole straw to keep you straw clean all the time. Carry Easily A metal tube case is included in the set. You can place it in your pocket or clip on your bags and take it anywhere you go. According to the report, the average person uses 38,000 or more plastic straws between the ages of 5 and 65 in their lifetime. From juice boxes, to smoothies, to sodas, to cocktails, we use straws in almost all kinds of beverages we consume. All that plastic has to end up somewhere and it usually ends up in landfills and the ocean. KELLECI Metal straws value pack includes ; 3 of telescopic reusable metal straw + 3 of alluminium case + 3 of telescopic cleaning brush + 3 of keychain Advantages of our telescopic metal straws 1. Compatible with most glasses, sports bottles, tumblers. Sized like a normal straw! 2. Dishwasher safe made with 100% BPA free, food grade 18/8 stainless steel material . three food grade silicone tips are also safe for kids! 3. Comes with our brush -- the best way to get all the gunk out of your straws, thereby preventing the buildup of bacteria and mold. 4. Comes with the portable cases .Easy to carry it on the go!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q7UMD88fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kelleci","source_asin":"B07XF4DTSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XF4DTSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XF4DTSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
