window.products.push({"id":422378,"name":"Somifently Banneton Proofing Basket for Sourdough Set of 2 Bread Basket 9 Inch Round with Dough Scraper Basting Brush Linen Liner Cloth for Bread Baki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QljBya0FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Did you have difficult to get your bread to rise properly ? Have you ever try to make a perfect sourdough bread ? Besides of the rich experience, you probably need these Proofing Baskets, also called Brotforms and Bannetons. Helps the loaves keep their shape and structure through their final rise. PACKING LIST 1. 9 inch Bread Proofing Basket * 22. Linen Liner Cloth * 23. Silicon Basting Brush * 14. Flexible Dough Scraper * 1No need to buy these tools separately, We provide you with everything you need to bake your next bread masterpiece—taste and presentation-wise. ● Material: 100% natural rattan, stainless nail ● Craft: Handmade ● Size: 9'' * 3.5'' How to Use The Banneton --STEP 1 Following your baking recipes and prepare the sourdough. Each basket can hold 1.5 pounds of bread dough. How to Use The Banneton -- STEP 2 Mist spray the banneton lightly with water, dust it with flour ( or a 50:50 mix of rice flour and all-purpose flour), and tip out the excess and leave it to dry. Then place the shaped dough in it and cover the basket with the linen liner cloth. How to Use The Banneton -- STEP 3 When the dough has risen, you just need to flip it out of the basket. You can also use the scoring lame to create beautiful patterns on the dough surface. How to Use The Banneton -- STEP 4 Following the recipes instruction and put the bread dough into oven. Then enjoy your wonderful homemade sourdough bread! Notice: Do not put the Proofing Basket into the oven! Please store dry Bannetons away from humid environment when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QljBya0FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Somifently","source_asin":"B08FJ35MH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FJ35MH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FJ35MH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
