window.products.push({"id":422479,"name":"Jiak Upgraded Version Silicone Oven Mitts-1 Pair；Silicone and Cotton Double-Layer Heat Resistant Gloves, BBQ Gloves/Cooking Gloves/Kitchen Gloves/Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FBdapTASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you make food with oven or barbecue outdoors, the most important is to protect yourself from high heat and flame. No matter you are a amateur pastry cook or experienced chef, the oven mitt is the only protective layer between fingers and hot baking tray. So it’s so necessary to have an appropriate oven mitt. The silica gel glove is made of food-grade silicon fully without BPA and nontoxic, a direct touch with food is available. The soft knitted cotton lining wraps your hands u, and the outer silica gel non-slip texture help you control what you hold more easily.  It can protect your hands, as well as to help you to deal with extremely hot stuff(baking tray, grill, taking eggs from boiling water...) There is a hanging ring in the tail and you can hang it around the oven or stove, saving much space and convenient to pick. In addition, it is not only suitable for oven and microwave oven, it also a good assistant in camp, barbecue, dealing with kitchen appliances, unscrewing the hot bulb and the fireplace. Glove materials:  outer food-grade and no BPA silicone and inner knitted cotton lining Glove size: 11 inches long Temperature scale: -40℉ to 450℉(-40℃ to 230℃) Package list: two oven mitts High-quality and multifunctional kitchen glove, being available indoors and outdoors. Water proofed and non-slip, with insulation and heat resistance, the glove can be used in barbecue, cooking and baking. It’s your best choice! Attention: Please don’t cut or scratch it with knife or other sharp stuff. The size in the picture and that of the real product has a little bit difference due to manual measuring. I WANT YOU KNOW THAT WE DON’T PRINT ANY WORDS, PATTERN AND LOGO ON THE GLOVE FOR YOU USING IT SAFELY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FBdapTASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jiak","source_asin":"B08J8GN2TG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J8GN2TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J8GN2TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
