window.products.push({"id":422548,"name":"The Kosher Cook Y Vegetable Peeler - Heavy Duty, Ultra Sharp Stainless Steel Blade - Swiss Peeler - Ergonomic Plastic Handle - Color Coded Kitchen Too","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y9Xnj2J-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your kitchen kosher while using the highest quality cookware with The Kosher Cook ! Our color coded plastic vegetable peelers for kitchen have ultra-sharp blades and comfortable handles to peel quickly and effectively. The colors and labels on each veggie peeler lets you know at a glance if it is meat, dairy or parve. PRODUCT FEATURES Classic Shaped Y Peeler Ergonomic Plastic Handle Ultra Sharp Carbon Stainless Steel Blade Does Not Require Tevilla (Certified by the Karlsburg Beis Din) Color Separated for Kosher Household: - Blue for Dairy (Milchig)- Red for Meat (Fleishig)- Green For Pareve- Also Available in Black, Pink and Yellow HIGH QUALITY DELUXE POTATO PEELERS Make your time in the kitchen a lot easier and stress-free by using our apple peeler that is made to provide you with absolute quality. Our fruit peeler is constructed with high grade plastic and strong carbon steel blade that will slice through the skins of the toughest fruits and vegetables with amazing finesse. KEEPING IT KOSHER The Kosher Cook provides a wide array of tools to help separate milchig, fleishig and parev. Color coded utensils and tools along with labels and stickers allow you to see at a glance if the item is dairy, meat or pareve. Whether you are new to keeping kashrut or a seasoned veteran looking to make life easier, the Kosher Cook has the tools to keep the highest standards of kosher cooking. ABOUT THE KOSHER COOK Part of the Ner Mitzvah family, The Kosher Cook is another way we to help you keep Jewish traditions and laws. Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert maker of household products and the premier source for traditional and gift Judaica items. Count on Ner Mitzvah for all Shabbat, Chanukah and Jewish Holiday needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y9Xnj2J-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kosher Cook","source_asin":"B07BS429G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BS429G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BS429G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
