window.products.push({"id":422564,"name":"2 Artificial Plants Fern Leaves Grass in Potted Sets Lifelike-Maidenhair Fern and Faux Boston Fern 13-13.5 inches for House Office Garden Indoor Outdo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ITvQ9Ml6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do You Want Beautiful Ferns Decoration For Your Home, Yard And Office? --These artificial ferns look so real that you have to touch it to believe that it is fake. --It is also easy to move around as you desire without worrying it to get damaged. --We always persist in improving products quality and after-sales service, more and more people will love this wonderful flower sprigs. --Cute artificial ferns, make your beautiful life. Notes: 1. As different computers display colors differently, the color of the actual item may vary slightly from the image shows, thanks for your understanding. 2. Due to long-distance transportation, flower spikes may fall off. But don’t worry, plug them back in and they won’t fall again. ABOUT TEAM Barika Bloom was established in July 2019 by Eva & Wii, two young, like-minded creative girls who met in Atlanta. Actually they are cousin-in-law. They still love fresh flowers, of course. After they have pets and young children, they found artificial plants are perfect. An amazing high number of plants and flowers have working toxicity levels. Besides, they don’t worried about their display wasted. This simple idea encouraged them to create their own brand，with the greenery for people who are looking for decorations that are anything but ordinary. The two of them feel lucky and grateful to be supported by their family and friends, which motivates them to build on their achievements, and allows their business to evolve. ABOUT US Barika means women like the blooming flowers in Latin. All the flowers, plants and greenery in our brand are unbelievably realistic. We choose our suppliers seriously. Only high quality, authenticity products can be added to our collection. We still encourage people to love fresh flowers. In fact, they work beautifully mixed in with our faux collection. But not only do artificial flowers last. They don’t need constant attention or replacement. With our collection, you can simply relax and enjoy your display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ITvQ9Ml6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barika Bloom","source_asin":"B08BYFVXJR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BYFVXJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BYFVXJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
