window.products.push({"id":422583,"name":"Tumblers with Lids (8 pack) 22oz Pastel Colored Acrylic Cups with Lids and Straws | Double Wall Matte Plastic Bulk Tumblers With FREE Straw Cleaner! V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yTb-EY4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅8 FUN YELLOW CUPS TO SHARE: When you’ve got a personality this vibrant, you need a sassy, colorful tumbler to match. Show off your free-wheeling spirit and playful vibes with the CUTEST acrylic tumblers on Amazon. Each set includes eight tumblers with lids and straws, so there are plenty to share with your fun-loving friends. Available in 16 oz. and 22 oz. sizes in your favorite to-go coffee cup shape in color-popping style! ✅HOURS OF TEMPERATURE CONTROL: Our premium plastic tumblers come with insulated double walls, meaning your drink stays at the same temperature HOURS after pouring. Keep water, lemonade and juice frosty-cold, while hot drinks like coffee, tea and hot cocoa will stay warm and toasty. With thick acrylic walls and vacuum-sealed insulation, you’ll never have to deal with annoying drink “sweat” or water rings ruining your surfaces, either! ✅SPLASH-PROOF AND EASY TO CLEAN: Our handy travel cup set is the most fun way to stay hydrated during hardcore gym sessions, make long days at the office a tad more bearable, or cool down at the beach with a refreshing smoothie or iced drink. These lightweight tumblers are breeze to quickly hand wash, and we’ve even tossed in a handy wire brush to easily clean out the inside of the reusable straws, too. ✅MATTE FINISH IS SILKY SMOOTH: Told everyone in the office you were quitting those sodas, iced coffees, and boba drinks, but don’t want prying co-workers to see you already had a sugar relapse? Our tumblers come in a conveniently opaque matte finish, which both conceals the contents and is comfy to hold as you enjoy your guilty pleasure... Bring it to the gym tomorrow, but in the meantime, no one will be able to tell what you’re drinking when you cave on cheat days. (We won’t tell if you won’t.) ✅PERFECT FOR CUSTOM CREATIONS: Break out the die-cutting machine and get crafty, because these bulk tumblers make the perfect canvas for monogramming. We’ve left obnoxious logos and brand names off each tumbler cup, so they’re beautiful blank slates just waiting to be personalized. Surprise your girlfriends with fabulous girls weekend gifts, include in bachelorette party and bridal shower gift bags, or decorate one for everyone in the family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yTb-EY4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STRATA CUPS","source_asin":"B0BNP93V7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNP93V7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNP93V7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
