window.products.push({"id":422592,"name":"Premium Designer Silicone Absorbent Drink Coasters with Felt mats - Stylish,STACKABLE, Furniture Protection, Non Slip, For kitchens, restaurant, bars,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517eCqG3MCL._AC_SL1032_.jpg","description":"🍷 Is this the best drink silicone coaster available on Amazon? Sure there are ones that solve some of life’s problems like condensation drips on clothing or protecting your precious surfaces but many are not stackable, prone to slipping and difficult to pick up in hurry. Crib Things™ coasters are 4.2” (10.5cm) in diameter and are low profile at 0.35” (0.9cm). Coming in a pack of six, Crib Things™ coasters are boxed ready for that perfect, Christmas, House Warming, Farewell, Birthday or Wedding Gift. Made with quality materials Whilst stylish and soft to the touch, the food grade silicone outer and industrial strength felt is incredibly hard wearing and can withstand hot and cold beverages . Place 3 or more Crib Things™ coasters together to create a safety pad or trivet for hot pots and pans in the kitchen or when serving. 🍷 Modern Stylish Colours and Designs 🇺🇸 🔴 ⚪️ USA available in RED and White - Raise a glass to freedom with these sets of 6 Red coasters each featuring a unique depiction of Old Glory! 🍹 Sunset Orange - A bright yet warm orange inspired by the tropics, perfect for placing your cocktail while watching the sun go down! 🍸 Purple Rain - It’s a little bit disco, it’s a little bit rock n’ roll! Lovers of purple will dig this! 🍺 Matt Black - The classic! A striking black coaster that is complementary to any setting. Perfect for those dark marble or granite kitchen tops or bars 🥛 Pure White - Minimalists rejoice, this breathtakingly white coaster is a pure as the driven snow. Perfect for those whiter than white settings. Brilliant for boaties looking for something to match their boat interiors or the crystal white sands of the Bahamas. 🥃 Mahogany Brown - Another classic… you have the Chesterfield and mahogany furniture to match… this is the coaster for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517eCqG3MCL._AC_SL1032_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crib Things","source_asin":"B07KWSJTZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KWSJTZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KWSJTZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
