window.products.push({"id":422851,"name":"Neanderthal Man Primitive Artifacts Stemmed Aterian Genuine Archeological Stemmed Tools ~1 1/2\" (Qty=1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31D4HCoi-bL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful Genuine Rare primitive man Neanderthal technology artifact . It is from the what is now the Sahara desert .It is over 1 1/2 \" long and 1\" wide, small to medium size;t he colors are browns in its finest and natural state; this treasure would definitely make a very rare and collectable piece; not for gem cutting nor carving. It is from the Late Middle Stone Age Era to Upper/Middle Paleolithic Era; it is 55,000 to 12,000 years old. These were used on spears, and as arrowheads, scrapers, and knives. Aterian tools from the now Sahara Desert were used by both Cro Magnon Man and Neanderthals; the tool making technology is in the Mousterian Lithic tradition and called Levallois; 1 specified buys 1 artifact, 3 buys 3 artifacts, etc. item shipped will vary slightly","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31D4HCoi-bL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uMuseum","source_asin":"B00B2BK4WA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-422851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B2BK4WA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B2BK4WA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
